    "a record literal whose constructor belongs to a DIFFERENT type than the position declares is REFUSED at a non-generic position and ACCEPTED at a generic one -- the value does not inhabit its declared type, which is the ordinary compiler floor DESIGN section 4b names, so this is a below-baseline safety regression and not a missing refinement. ",
    "HARM: an ill-typed program is Accepted with no diagnostic of any kind. Nothing downstream re-asks the question, so the wrong constructor travels as though it had been judged. ",
