    "RELATED CLASS: gunbc.recurring_failure_mode.direct_generic_application_admits_a_distinct_phantom_argument records distinct applications of the same owner accepted at a direct-call parameter. The Arrow guard alone leaves that second baseline fixture accepted. ",
